# Search-path exclusions — read by ripgrep, fd, and the agent tooling built on them.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS: searches drowned in decoys (6 full tree copies under
# .claude/worktrees/, a retired Node widget shell that outnumbered the live UI ~20:1).
# The Node shell is now deleted: git tag `legacy-archive-2026-10-23`
# (restore: `git checkout legacy-archive-2026-10-23 -- legacy/<path>`).

# Agent worktrees — full duplicate checkouts. Never the file you want.
.claude/worktrees/

# Vendored build output (llama.cpp ships a whole web UI under build/ that answers
# to index.html searches and has nothing to do with this project's client).
core/vendor/*/build/
